y-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The construction panel — track and station options with live cost estimates</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Achievements: 2 of 9 unlocked — Track Builder and First Station\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1757555519/screenshot_2025-09-10_at_9.51.45_PM.png\" alt=\"Achievements: 2 of 9 unlocked — Track Builder and First Station\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1757555519/screenshot_2025-09-10_at_9.51.45_PM.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/v1757555519/screenshot_2025-09-10_at_9.51.45_PM.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1757555519/screenshot_2025-09-10_at_9.51.45_PM.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/v1757555519/screenshot_2025-09-10_at_9.51.45_PM.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Achievements: 2 of 9 unlocked — Track Builder and First Station\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1600\" style=\"--splay-rot:1.06deg;\" data-dimensions=\"2400×1600\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Achievements: 2 of 9 unlocked — Track Builder and First Station</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The transit-operations event log — the simulation keeps receipts\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/v1759077479/screenshot_2025-09-28_at_12.37.44_PM.png\" alt=\"The transit-operations event log — the simulation keeps receipts\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/v1759077479/screenshot_2025-